{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn7le07ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le07ob05re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn7le07ob05re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn7le07ob05re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Do you agree with this article on healthy eating, Peter? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  I guess it might be true. After all, they say \u201cYou are what you eat\u201d. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  In that case, I'm going to be a creamy burrito casserole after dinner tonight! <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  I must be a grilled peanut butter and jelly sandwich!  That's what I had for lunch. Can you tell me what are some more interesting ideas for meals? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Sure, that would be fun.  You also need to include more healthy choices.", "id": 1, "time": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le07ob05re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Could you show me how I can select better things to eat? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You should aim to prepare foods that are low in fat and high in protein.\nMeat, fish, and poultry may be a good source of nutrients iron, zinc, and B vitamins. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  I may become a vegetarian.", "id": 2, "time": "28500"}, {"image": "engenn7le07ob05re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  It could be that you get enough protein from a vegetarian diet as long as the variety and amounts of foods consumed are adequate. It all comes down to making sure you eat something from each of the major food groups: grains, vegetables, fruits, milk and beans.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Where does chocolate go? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh, Peter!", "id": 3, "time": "46000"}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about food and drink.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can speculate about feelings and impressions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can ask for help or advice. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "What does the expression \u201cYou are what you eat\u201d mean to you? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Do you agree with this expression? Why or why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "A burrito casserole ... How does that sound?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "STI", "questions": [{"responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " Vanessa and Peter talk about what they eat.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "te